# Anchored to the build-context root with a leading slash so these never match
# same-named directories deeper in the tree. /data is the runtime DB + ATT&CK
# cache dir, created at run time; the app's own packaged data (the log source
# catalog) lives under backend/app/catalog and is always shipped.
/.git
/.github
/data
/docs
/backend/.venv
/backend/tests
/backend/.pytest_cache
/frontend/node_modules
/frontend/dist
**/__pycache__
*.db
*.sqlite3
.env
